{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-35","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial and the rectangle contained by them medial and moreover incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them.","book":10,"number":35,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.35","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.35/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":35,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","contentId":"euclid-10-35","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33ed305a6de9c11e5f39f1a9d2e63586a87110231d99dc486a3d1663c32e1db1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-35.statement","euclid-10-35.construction.1","euclid-10-35.proof.1","euclid-10-35.proof.2","euclid-10-35.proof.3","euclid-10-35.proof.4","euclid-10-35.proof.5","euclid-10-35.proof.6","euclid-10-35.proof.7","euclid-10-35.conclusion","euclid-10-35.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-35.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23330d0636cd45ff04db8ff396cc420dbc8617008cfa1800e7afcacba7bcaba1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial and the rectangle contained by them medial and moreover incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到正方形的不可公度直线,这两条直线的总数分别为正方形和中项无理线段直线和矩形直线,另外不可公度直线的总数为正方形直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65c0eee12a7e8a0684929233339ec9a5d83ee99c40f409d6ed0aed61bbcdcfe8","citations":["euclid-10-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out two medial straight lines AB, BC commensurable in square only, containing a medial rectangle, and such that the square on AB is greater than the square on BC by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AB; [[X. 32](/principles/euclid-10-32) , ad fin.] let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, and let the rest of the construction be as above."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出2,中项无理线段,AB,BC,平方可公度而长度不可公度,矩形,AB,正方形,比正方形,BC,正方形,不可公度,AB直线,BC,AB;]（相关点与线段：ADB） [ [X. 32](/principles/euclid-10-32)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19193c0517866053e60e78ac64b4ea068393b59252a98ff8211b6f5c5e695aa7","citations":["euclid-10-18","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AF is incommensurable in length with FB, [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18) ] AD is also incommensurable in square with DB. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF是不可公度 FB是AD也是不可公度 DB也是 [ [ [X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c616084a8b810eefc4621c9360ef02739879d600091d7e2f323628392e1e37fc","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AB is medial, therefore the sum of the squares on AD, DB is also medial. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) , [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB正方形中项无理线段, AD正方形ADDB中项无理线段 [ [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73219f5d72bda8acfe4f108c55fcdc4f4237ecf60edf671d319fd836bb0aaeb8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AF, FB is equal to the square on each of the straight lines BE, DF, therefore BE is equal to DF; therefore BC is double of FD, so that the rectangle AB, BC is also double of the rectangle AB, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AF,FB等于每条直线的正方形,BE,DF,BE等于DF;因此,BC是FD的两倍,矩形 AB,BC也是矩形 AB,FD的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"948a70ccb90405bd4306debb3bef80191e16bb50f90cf1cb3c3e7122ef89775f","citations":["euclid-10-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, BC is medial; therefore the rectangle AB, FD is also medial. [[X. 32, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 AB,BC是中项无理线段,因此矩形 AB,FD也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 32, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61a9a54976de88dfa6ed10fdc844f54d17a1ae258f7285b1c8a300086134c55b","citations":["euclid-10-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to the rectangle AD, DB; [[Lemma after X. 32](/principles/euclid-10-32) ] therefore the rectangle AD, DB is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于矩形 AD,DB,矩形,DB,矩形,中项无理线段,矩形,中项无理线段,中项无理线段。 [ [引理 after X. 32](/principles/euclid-10-32)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"444bfc0e4eca328ed8208d9e9d614bfcbf90d73e63172fa8a43351675d43f65a","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is incommensurable in length with BC, while CB is commensurable with BE, therefore AB is also incommensurable in length with BE, [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13) ] so that the square on AB is also incommensurable with the rectangle AB, BE. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是不可公度,BC是BE,AB也是不可公度,BE也是不可公度（相关点与线段：CB） [ [ [X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92a37018b178f19289cea2aea8dadca91b2eebad07319cf7c7d2f6d3c498898e","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AD, DB are equal to the square on AB, [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47) ] and the rectangle AB, FD, that is, the rectangle AD, DB, is equal to the rectangle AB, BE; therefore the sum of the squares on AD, DB is incommensurable with the rectangle AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AD,DB的正方形等于AB,AB,矩形,FD,即矩形,AD,DB,矩形,AB,矩形,AB,矩形,矩形,AD,不可公度,矩形,矩形,矩形。（相关点与线段：BE） [ [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6c6ce42abb033116942d9012aa67099b153b12edc3d16dddd65b106cdf4ff1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two straight lines AD, DB incommensurable in square have been found which make the sum of the squares on them medial and the rectangle contained by them medial and moreover incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在正方形中发现两条直线AD、DB、不可公度, 这两条直线的总数分别为正方形和中项无理线段,矩形由中项无理线段和不可公度,正方形由正方形和正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-35.source","contentId":"euclid-10-35","revisionId":"euclid-10-35@raw-33ed305a6de9c11e","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f2fd1895e8b1891ce6965c5a69587e4e5b3483e44f6e64a93e2c337d2eba854","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.35/\